businesses.description:
Manson Industrial is a global manufacturing and product development company with offices in Australia, China, the UK, and the US. Manson Industrial owns 8 factories in China, and works with over 300 contracted manufacturers globally. We help E-commerce stores, consumer brands, Amazon sellers, retailers and wholesalers to design, develop, source, manufacture, package, and ship products to their specific requirements and locations worldwide.

Highlights of Manson Industrial:

- 8 owned factories in China;

- 10+ years manufacturing expertise;

- 50M+ units manufactured with <0.5% defect rate;

- Comprehensive product development and engineering;

- End-to-end supply chain management.

