We currently hold several contacts where we provide a 24/7 response across the Perth Metropolitan area to provide any of the following services;

• Bridge maintenance and repair including heavy structural steel and concrete works;

• Steel fabrication and installation services including corrosion control;

• Civil construction including road and rail bridge construction;

• Rail Safety Consultancy including the development and submission of Rail Safety Management Plans and the provision of highly experienced track protection officers.

• Licensed building works

• Freeway crash barrier repairs;

• Welding services;

• Building maintenance & repair services to carpentry & joinery items (planned & unplanned) as required;

• Glazing, flooring and stainless steel welding panel contracts;

